  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 模组。用心制作。大量适用于 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">瓶装空气（Bottled Air）是一个模组，它提供了另一种在水下停留更长时间的方式。除了药水和潮涌核心，你现在还可以从空的玻璃瓶中吸出空气。只需在游泳时右击一个空瓶子，当气泡条可见时即可完成。默认情况下，这会补充玩家一半的气泡值。<br><br>为了防止在此过程中你的背包被水瓶子完全填满，你可以在副手持有一种火源类物品。当前的火源类方块有<em><strong>营火、火焰弹、熔岩桶和岩浆块</strong></em>。当副手持有这些方块之一时，新生成的水瓶会蒸发掉，并返回玻璃瓶。默认情况下，此过程中玻璃瓶有 50% 的几率破碎。去探索那个水下世界吧！</span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含于 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum's QoL Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"运行环境：服务端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>disableWaterConsumptionUnderwater</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果启用，玩家将无法在水下饮用水瓶，以防止获得无限氧气。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>holdFireTypeItemInOffhandToPreventWaterBottleCreation</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在副手持有火源类方块时阻止水瓶生成（蒸发掉）。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>chanceGlassBottleBreaksWithFireTypeInOffhand</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 0.5，最小值 0，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">当副手物品蒸发水时玻璃瓶破碎的几率，返回一个空的（空气）瓶子。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>amountOfAirInBottles</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 150，最小值 0，最大值 1000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">一个空瓶子所含的空气量。在原版 Minecraft 中，最大空气供应量为 300。</span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>跳入水中，从空瓶子里吸出空气，以便在水下游泳更长时间：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/bottled-air/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"518\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>每个玻璃瓶能补充一半的气泡值。在蒸发过程中，有 50% 的几率瓶子会破碎：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/bottled-air/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"518\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>当然，你也可以不副手持有火源类方块：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/bottled-air/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>你可以自由地在任何整合包中使用此模组，只要下载链接仍然托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统内。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">评论已禁用，因为我无法在众多独立的模组页面上追踪它们。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他任何事，请访问&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
